VIN vid GND 0 AC 1
E4 vout1 GND voutp1 voutn1 1
VIINP vin vinn 0
VIINN vip vipp 0
R1 vinn net2 {R1}
R3 net2 vi_ota_n {R3}
C1 net2 net1 {C1}
C3 voutn2 voutp2 {C3}
R11 vipp net1 {R1}
R31 net1 vi_ota_p {R3}
C21 vi_ota_p voutn1 {C2}
